> **LEMMA HE6-3 (slope counts, (SEP)-FREE).** With
> n_λ := #{ρ : f(ρ) = 0, dv(Φ′(ρ)) = λ}: (a) P(F) has no slope ≤ D′h;
> (b) n_λ = D′L_λ for every slope λ. **No hypothesis of the (SEP) kind that
