### S7.1 HE6-BOX-1 [r1 WIDENED] (the deeper read at a REPEATED residual factor r with ℓ·deg r ≥ 2 — at ANY ℓ)

> **[r1, R1] THE BOX IS WIDER THAN THIS SECTION ORIGINALLY SAID.** Codex PE1
