> the unique 0 ≤ i₀ < e₁ with i₀h ≡ k (mod e₁). The set of residues realised
> as res(C(θ)/ϖ(θ)^{k}) by C ∈ O[x] with deg C < D′ and dv(C) = k is
>
>     { Σ_{t ∈ T(k)} c_t·η_θ^{t} : c_t ∈ F_Q, not all 0 },
>     T(k) := { t < f₁ : k ≥ (i₀ + e₁t)·h } ,
