    res( C(ξ)/n_{i+1}(k)(ξ) ) = Σ_{t<g_i} ι_ξ^{(i)}(γ_t·ϑ_t)·β_{i,ξ}^{t}
        = ι_ξ^{(i+1)}( Σ_{t<g_i} γ_t·ϑ_t·β_i^{t} ) ,

using ι_ξ^{(i+1)}|_{K_i} = ι_ξ^{(i)} and ι_ξ^{(i+1)}(β_i) = β_{i,ξ}.
Since r_i is irreducible over K_i of degree g_i, {1, β_i, …,
