**THE GAP, exactly.** The S1 normalizer row justified the n̂₂-vs-n₂
discrepancy by "unit-residue discrepancy in K₂^× only; σ-content
twist-invariant per HE7 §S1 CONVENTION (J-D0)". HE7's CONVENTION
